#==============================================================================================
#
#   stacking_context - Painting::StackingContext: painting order and hit testing
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/Painting/StackingContext.cpp (lines 1-492) and StackingContext.h: a
#       stacking context of the paint tree with its child contexts sorted by z-index and tree
#       order, the positioned descendants and floats it paints, painting in CSS 2.1 Appendix
#       E order (with the per-phase command cache of each paintable box, masks and clips),
#       hit testing in reverse painting order, and the stacking context tree dump of the
#       Layout tests.
